    "This manual introduces the Plugin Manager page of Cisum: how to view registered plugins, search and filter by category, and enable or disable a plugin." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This manual introduces the Plugin Manager page of Cisum: how to view registered plugins, search and filter by category, and enable or disable a plugin."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "本说明书介绍 Cisum 的「插件管理」页面：如何查看已注册插件、搜索与分类筛选，以及如何启用或停用某个插件。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant-HK" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "本說明書介紹 Cisum 的「外掛程式管理」頁面：如何檢視已註冊外掛程式、搜尋與分類篩選，以及如何啟用或停用某個外掛程式。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant-TW" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "本說明書介紹 Cisum 的「外掛程式管理」頁面：如何檢視已註冊外掛程式、搜尋與分類篩選，以及如何啟用或停用某個外掛程式。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Toggle the Enable switch in the top-right corner to enable or disable the plugin instantly." : {
      "localizations" : {
